{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"どーもー(｡･ω･)ﾉﾞ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近のまなったんは\nPV撮影をしたりしてましたよ〜♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今までのPVにない世界観で\nすごく素敵だった(∩^ω^∩)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"未央奈も一緒に頑張ってるよ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだまだ7th制作は続くので\n体調整えて突っ走るぞっ(`･v･´)ゞ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生写真のロリータさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2013/10/12/8970289/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぎゅーーーーーっ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さてさて〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は最後の○○○"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんでしょうか...？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チクタクチクタクチクタク"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"忘れたなんて\n言わせないからねっ｀‐ω‐´)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてお寝坊さんも\n許さないからねっ♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうです、お分かりの通り\nガールズルールラストの\n握手会(((っ･ω･)っ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうラストなのかぁ(｡´･ω･)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"7th目の握手会スケジュールも\n出たけどどんなに早くても\n次は12/8(´･ω･ゞ)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゔぅーさみしいよぉ。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日たくさんぎゅ〜っ♡てして\n来てくれた人みんなに\n幸せな気持ちになって\n帰ってもらいたいですヽ(｡･ω･)ﾉﾞ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日はね〜また私服以外の\n何かも着ちゃうから\nなんだろなぁ？って想像して\n楽しみにしてて下さ〜い♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、先にいっておくと\nメイド服じゃないからね（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"漢字二文字の服装です♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メイド服はまた7thのどこかで♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会での必殺技リクエストや\nやってほしいことあったら\nぜひぜひ〜(`･v･´)ゞ♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういえば今日\n明日の握手の部数分のマカロンを\n帰りに買ってきたので明日は\n1部終わるごとにマカロンを\n一つ食べることにしました(｡･ω･)ﾉﾞ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぱくっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2013/10/12/8970289/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日振り入れをしてて\n休憩中に真夏が美彩に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『みしゃしぇんぱい しゅき〜♪』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『みしゃみしゃちゅー♡』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とか言って美彩にくっつきに行ったら\nノってくれるかなー？と思いきや"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『ちゃんと喋らんかいっ！！！』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と怒られました...(´°ω°｀)ショボン"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"けどめげずに後ろから\nちょこんと抱きついたよ♡笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とまぁ、こんな感じで美彩とは\nよくジャレておりますヽ(｡･ω･｡)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2013/10/12/8970289/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日のお昼までは真夏日だったけど\n夜はすっごく寒い〜ヾ(｡><)ｼ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ニットやブーツが\nちょうどよさそう_(┐「ε:)_"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃあ明日のために\nぐっすり寝ていい夢\n見ましょ〜(人-ω-)♪♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"P.S.若月！舞台お疲れ様(∩^ω^∩)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ストイックに頑張ってる姿が本当に\n素敵だったよ〜(ToT)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たまたまお仕事と被って\n舞台見にいけなかったけど\nまたこういう機会があったら\n行かせてもらいたいなぁ♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当におつかれさま♡"}],"source":"archive"}